<div id="__nuxt"><div><main id="main-content" class="default-layout__main"><!--[--><div data-page="[subpath1]/[uid].vue"><div class="outer-container"><div><!--[--><section id="delivering-tomorrow&#39;s-talent-today" class="page-header page-header--standard" index="0" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__container" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__content" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__text-content" data-v-93adf07f><!----><h1 class="page-header__title" data-v-93adf07f>Delivering tomorrow&#39;s talent today</h1><!--v-if--></div><!----></div><div class="page-header__media" data-v-93adf07f><div class="page-header__media-text-image" data-v-93adf07f><img src="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5oicpbqstJ99_UT_Evri-Careers-typface.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max" srcset="https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5oicpbqstJ99_UT_Evri-Careers-typface.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5oicpbqstJ99_UT_Evri-Careers-typface.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://ev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z5oicpbqstJ99_UT_Evri-Careers-typface.svg?q=50&amp;auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="1339" height="200" class="page-header__text-image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-93adf07f></div></div></div><!----></section><section id="early-careers" class="section-wrapper" index="1" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><div class="card__image" data-v-e1e30b9c><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCmk51ZCF7ETPWM_Grace1-1-a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCmk51ZCF7ETPWM_Grace1-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCmk51ZCF7ETPWM_Grace1-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCmk51ZCF7ETPWM_Grace1-1-.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="6000" height="3368" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-e1e30b9c></div><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Early careers</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ever wondered where a career in a fast‑moving, ever‑evolving business could take you? Curious about how your fresh ideas, energy and ambition could help shape the future of delivery in the UK? Or maybe you’re simply looking for a place where you can learn, grow and be yourself from day one?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sounds like you?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Then welcome — you’re exactly where you should be.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we know that the next big innovation, the next smarter way of working, the next bold idea that transforms how millions of parcels move every day… could come from someone right at the start of their career. That’s why we’re passionate about investing in emerging talent. Whether you’re joining us as an apprentice, graduate, placement student or through one of our specialist pathways, you’ll be stepping into a business that thrives on momentum.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->We do Early Careers because we believe talent doesn’t have to wait. We believe learning should be hands‑on, support should be genuine, and opportunities should be open to everyone, no matter your background or starting point. And above all, we believe that the future of Evri will be built by people like you — curious, ambitious and ready to make a difference.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->So if you’re looking for a place where you can kick‑start your career, bring your personality to work and be part of something that’s always moving forward… you’re in the right place.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="graduate-schemes" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acvEUJGXnQHGZIZZ_NasimStyle1a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acvEUJGXnQHGZIZZ_NasimStyle1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acvEUJGXnQHGZIZZ_NasimStyle1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/acvEUJGXnQHGZIZZ_NasimStyle1.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="2718" height="4830" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--standard landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Graduate schemes</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--standard landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Ready to kick‑start your career in a place where you can make a real impact from day one?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> Our Graduate Programme is designed to give you exactly that. You won’t just be watching from the sidelines — you’ll be diving straight into real projects, taking on meaningful responsibility and building hands‑on experience that sets you up for an incredible future at Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From the moment you join, you’ll have a dedicated mentor in your corner, guiding you, supporting you and helping you grow. You’ll develop new skills, stretch your capabilities and learn on the job in a fast‑moving business that’s always evolving. And although you’ll be based in one home department, you’ll also get the chance to explore other teams across Evri — giving you a full 360° view of how our business works.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Typical Graduate areas: <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>We offer graduate opportunities across several exciting areas: <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Finance, Procurement, Commercial, Data<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Sustainability and many more<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Each one gives you something different — but they all offer challenge, variety and plenty of room to shine.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What you’ll need to bring:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->minimum 2:2 degree<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> (some roles may require a 2:1)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Right to work in the UK<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> without sponsorship<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->curious mind<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, a <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->willingness to learn<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and the resilience to thrive in a fast‑paced environment<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Demonstratable interest in the area you’ve applied for<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For some roles: A <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->full, clean driving licence and car<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> The ability to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->travel nationally<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or visit one of our key locations up to twice a week<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How long is the adventure?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>Typically <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->2–3 years<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, depending on your scheme.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><button data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-3 e-button--icon-right landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--standard" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Applications for 2026 closed<!--]--></span></button><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="what-it&#39;s-like-to-join-our-graduate-schemes" class="video-banner video-banner--full-width" aria-labelledby="v-0-0-0-3-0" index="3" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-banner__container" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-banner__content" data-v-f796ae2d><h2 id="v-0-0-0-3-0" class="video-banner__title" data-v-f796ae2d>What it&#39;s like to join our graduate schemes</h2><p class="video-banner__text" data-v-f796ae2d>Hear directly from our incredible graduates who have come on-board straight out of university to develop their skills in a fast-moving and diverse work environment. William, Fatimah and Antonia walk us through the opportunities they were granted and how Evri was able to support them in their professional journey.</p></div><div class="video-banner__video-wrapper" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-player" data-v-f796ae2d data-v-d71d9176><div class="video-player__player" data-v-d71d9176><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1057596901?h=27c241e35f&amp;amp;badge=0&amp;amp;autopause=0&amp;amp;player_id=0&amp;amp;app_id=58479" title="Evri Graduate Program" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" width="100%" height="100%" data-v-d71d9176></iframe></div><!----></div></div></div></section><section id="apprenticeships" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--white" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoa51ZCF7ETPW6_Livaa942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoa51ZCF7ETPW6_Liva.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoa51ZCF7ETPW6_Liva.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoa51ZCF7ETPW6_Liva.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="2718" height="4830" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--white landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Apprenticeships</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--white landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->At Evri, we’re passionate about developing future talent — and our apprenticeships are a brilliant way to kick‑start your career while learning from the people who know our business best. You won’t just gain hands‑on experience in your role; you’ll also build job‑specific skills and knowledge through a structured apprenticeship programme delivered by one of our trusted training providers.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our apprenticeships run anywhere from <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->18 months to 4 years<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, depending on the programme and level you apply for. We typically offer opportunities from <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Level 3 (A‑Level equivalent)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> through to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Level 6 (Degree level)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> but make sure to check the advert for the programme you’re interested in for any specific entry requirements.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Throughout your journey, you’ll have a whole support network cheering you on — from your experienced workplace mentor to your Skills Coach and your Tutor. You may also need to attend occasional face‑to‑face workshops as part of your training, giving you even more opportunities to learn, grow and connect.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Typical apprenticeship areas:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>Commercial • Tech • Operations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What you’ll need to bring:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->GCSE Maths and English at <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->grade 4–9 (A–C)<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Any additional qualification requirements listed in the advert<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A willingness to learn, grow and take on new challenges<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Curiosity, resilience and the drive to thrive in a fast‑paced environment<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->An interest in the area you’ve applied for<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->The ability to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->travel to<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> the location you’ve applied for<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Right to work in the UK<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> without sponsorship<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Have lived in the UK for <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->3+ years<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How long is the adventure?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>18 months to 4 years, depending on the apprenticeship level and programme.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><button data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-2 e-button--icon-right landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--white" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Applications for 2026 closed<!--]--></span></button><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="hear-from-our-apprentices" class="video-banner video-banner--full-width" aria-labelledby="v-0-0-0-5-0" index="5" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-banner__container" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-banner__content" data-v-f796ae2d><h2 id="v-0-0-0-5-0" class="video-banner__title" data-v-f796ae2d>Hear from our apprentices</h2><!----></div><div class="video-banner__video-wrapper" data-v-f796ae2d><div class="video-player" data-v-f796ae2d data-v-d71d9176><div class="video-player__player" data-v-d71d9176><iframe src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/1160286818?h=a4055b6519&amp;title=0&amp;byline=0&amp;portrait=0" title="National Apprenticeship Week 2026" allow="autoplay; fullscreen; picture-in-picture" width="100%" height="100%" data-v-d71d9176></iframe></div><!----></div></div></div></section><section id="industrial-placements" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--neutral" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-feature-banner__image-container" data-v-54256dfc><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoQJ1ZCF7ETPWy_Untitleddesigna942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoQJ1ZCF7ETPWy_Untitleddesign.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoQJ1ZCF7ETPWy_Untitleddesign.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/aeCoQJ1ZCF7ETPWy_Untitleddesign.png?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt width="2718" height="4830" class="landing-feature-banner__image landing-feature-banner__image--image-right" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-54256dfc></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__content--image-right landing-feature-banner__content--neutral landing-feature-banner__content" data-v-54256dfc><!----><!----><h2 class="landing-feature-banner__title" data-v-54256dfc>Industrial placements</h2><div class="landing-feature-banner__rich-text landing-feature-banner__rich-text--neutral landing-feature-banner__rich-text--padding" data-v-54256dfc><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our industrial placements give you a fully immersive year in the world of Evri — a chance to roll up your sleeves, get stuck into real business projects, learn directly in the role and work alongside people who are experts in what they do. It’s your opportunity to see how the industry really works and head back to university feeling inspired, confident and full of new ideas.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Each placement runs for <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->1 year<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> and is designed for students in their <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->penultimate year of university<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. Everything you learn will complement your degree, helping you connect your academic knowledge to real‑life business challenges. You’ll return to your studies with a stronger skillset and a clearer understanding of where your future career could take you.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Typical areas:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>Most recently, our industrial placements have been based within <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Operations<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, but opportunities can change year by year — so keep a close eye on our careers pages for the latest updates.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->What you’ll need to bring:<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></p><ul><!--[--><!--[--><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->on track for a 2:2 or above<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Be in your <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->penultimate year of university<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A willingness to learn, grow and take on new challenges<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->A genuine interest in the area you’re applying for<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><li><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->For some roles: A <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->full, clean driving licence and car<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> The ability to <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->travel nationally<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or visit one of our key locations up to twice a week<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></li><!--]--><!--]--></ul><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->How long is the adventure?<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--><!--]--><!--[--><br>Around <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->1 year<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, depending on the programme.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><div class="landing-feature-banner__button-wrapper" data-v-54256dfc><button data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-primary e-button--variant-2 e-button--icon-right landing-feature-banner__button landing-feature-banner__button--neutral" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" data-v-54256dfc style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Applications for 2026 closed<!--]--></span></button><!----></div><!----></div></div></section><section id="other-opportunities" class="section-wrapper" index="7" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Other opportunities</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->From time to time, we may also offer additional opportunities such as <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->work experience programmes<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> or <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->summer internships<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. These are offered on an <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->ad‑hoc basis<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, depending on business needs, so it’s worth checking back on this page regularly for the latest updates.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Work experience<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> usually involves spending <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->1–2 weeks<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> with one of our teams to gain insight into what they do and how their work contributes to the wider organisation. You won’t be expected to complete tasks yourself — instead, you’ll <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->shadow colleagues<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->, observe the day‑to‑day environment and come away with a clearer understanding of different roles and potential future study or career paths.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Our <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->summer internships<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> typically take place during the university summer break and are <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->paid opportunities<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if--> lasting between <!--]--><!--]--><strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->4–12 weeks<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></strong><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->. During this time, you’ll get hands‑on exposure to your team’s work, contribute to structured projects and start applying some of what you’ve learned at university or college in a real business setting.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><button data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--icon card__button" data-gtm-track="button-Applications for 2026 closed" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href data-v-e1e30b9c style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><div class="e-button__icon" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_right" data-test-id="chevron_right" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron right</title> <g> <path d="M12.6 12L8.7 8.1C8.52 7.92 8.42 7.68 8.42 7.4C8.42 7.12 8.52 6.88 8.7 6.7C8.88 6.52 9.12 6.42 9.4 6.42C9.68 6.42 9.92 6.52 10.1 6.7L14.7 11.3C14.8 11.4 14.87 11.51 14.91 11.62C14.95 11.74 14.97 11.87 14.97 12C14.97 12.13 14.95 12.26 14.91 12.38C14.87 12.49 14.8 12.6 14.7 12.7L10.1 17.3C9.92 17.48 9.68 17.57 9.4 17.57C9.12 17.57 8.88 17.48 8.7 17.3C8.52 17.12 8.42 16.88 8.42 16.6C8.42 16.32 8.52 16.08 8.7 15.9L12.6 12Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div><!--]--></div><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[--> Applications for 2026 closed<!--]--></span></button><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="section-wrapper" class="section-wrapper wrapper" index="8" data-v-4131e9ee data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><div data-v-4131e9ee><div data-v-4131e9ee data-v-46f2ddf6><div id="recruitment-process" class="list-block__text-container" data-v-46f2ddf6><h2 class="list-block__title" data-v-46f2ddf6>Recruitment process</h2><p class="list-block__desc" data-v-46f2ddf6>How do you apply? Our recruitment journey has three stages, with shortlisting at each point. You&#39;ll need to pass each stage to move forward - and don&#39;t worry, we&#39;ll keep things clear, supportive and engaging from start to finish.</p></div><!--[--><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>1</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Application form</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Start by completing our online application form and answering a few initial questions so we can get to know you better. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>2</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Video interview</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->You&#39;ll record answers to four questions that help us understand your motivation for the role and your interest in Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>3</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Assessment centre</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->If you&#39;re successful, you&#39;ll be invited to a face-to-face assessment centre at the role location or the nearest suitable site. On the day, you&#39;ll take part in a variety of activities designed to help us get to know you - and give you a real feel for life at Evri.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><section class="link-block__container" data-v-46f2ddf6 data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__item" data-v-66bd53df><div class="link-block__icon" data-v-66bd53df><div class="e-pill e-pill--variant-brand-04" data-v-66bd53df data-v-90b78bdf><span class="e-pill__value--dark e-pill__value" data-test-id="pill-value" data-v-90b78bdf>4</span></div></div><div class="link-block__content" data-v-66bd53df><h2 class="link-block__title u-font-style-h5" data-v-66bd53df>Offer</h2><div class="link-block__cms-rich-text link-block__cms-rich-text" data-v-66bd53df><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Successful candidates will receive their offer within two weeks of attending the assessment centre. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div></div></section><!--]--></div></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="candidate-and-parent/guardian-zone" class="section-wrapper" index="9" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-ebc71926><div class="section-wrapper__container" data-v-ebc71926><!--[--><!----><!----><!--[--><div class="e-card-wrapper card card--no-cta card--no-image" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card--elevation-0 e-card" data-test-id="e-card" data-v-4984035c><div class="e-card__body" data-test-id="card-body" data-v-4984035c><!--[--><!----><div class="card__content" data-v-e1e30b9c><!----><div class="card__content--text" data-v-e1e30b9c><h2 class="card__title u-font-style-h3" data-v-e1e30b9c>Candidate and parent/guardian zone</h2><div class="card__text" data-v-e1e30b9c><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Coming soon!<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!----><!----></div></div><!--]--></div><!----></div><!----></div><!--]--><dialog class="e-modal frequent-seller-signup-modal" data-test-id="modal-card" aria-label="Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready" data-v-e1e30b9c data-v-d4c8c135 data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__content" data-v-a7583600><div class="e-modal__header" data-v-a7583600><!----></div><div class="e-avatar e-avatar--size-m e-avatar--color-brand-01-tint-5 e-avatar-bordered e-avatar-bordered--neutral-05 e-modal__avatar" style="" data-test-id="modal-avatar" aria-hidden="true" data-v-a7583600 data-v-4b59c4a2><!----><div class="e-icon" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="success" data-test-id="avatar-icon" data-v-4b59c4a2 data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="32" width="32" style="line-height:32px" viewBox="0 0 32 32" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>Success</title> <path opacity="0.2" d="M7.3 25.76C-0.35 18.92 3.31 7.11 9.69 4C4.74 22.65 20.04 26.54 28 21.87C26.41 27.31 14.94 32.6 7.3 25.76Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path d="M24.76 11.75L13.6 22.91L7.24 16.55L8.35 15.44L13.6 20.69L23.65 10.64L24.76 11.75Z" fill="#006BAA"/> <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M16 1.71C23.88 1.71 30.29 8.12 30.29 16C30.29 23.88 23.88 30.29 16 30.29C8.12 30.29 1.71 23.88 1.71 16C1.71 8.12 8.12 1.71 16 1.71ZM16 3.27C8.98 3.27 3.27 8.98 3.27 16C3.27 23.02 8.98 28.73 16 28.73C23.02 28.73 28.73 23.02 28.73 16C28.73 8.98 23.02 3.27 16 3.27Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </svg></div><!----></div><h2 class="e-modal__heading" data-test-id="heading" data-v-a7583600>Your Frequent Seller account is nearly ready</h2><!----><div class="e-modal__slot-wrapper" data-test-id="slot-wrapper" data-v-a7583600><!--[--><div class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__content" data-v-d4c8c135><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> We need to log you out to update your pricing. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__body" data-v-d4c8c135> Simply log back in and start booking parcels to see your new discounts automatically applied. </p><p class="frequent-seller-signup-modal__countdown" aria-live="assertive" aria-atomic="true" data-v-d4c8c135> Logging you out in 10 seconds... </p></div><!--]--></div><!----></div></dialog><!--]--></div></section><section id="faqs---applying-for-roles" class="faqs" index="10" data-v-6bee4b86><div class="faqs-content" data-v-6bee4b86><h2 class="faqs-title" data-v-6bee4b86>FAQs - Applying for roles</h2><!--[--><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-When do Evri recruit for Early Careers roles?-open answer" data-test-id="whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>When do Evri recruit for Early Careers roles?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="whendoevrirecruitforearlycareersroles-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Graduate and Industrial Placement roles will be advertised from late October/ early November each year until the end of December.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Apprenticeship roles will be open to apply for from mid-January and close at the end of February.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="caniapplyformorethanonerole-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-caniapplyformorethanonerole" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-caniapplyformorethanonerole" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-Can I apply for more than one role?-open answer" data-test-id="caniapplyformorethanonerole-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="caniapplyformorethanonerole-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>Can I apply for more than one role?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 9.12 17.57 9.4C17.57 9.68 17.48 9.92 17.3 10.1L12.7 14.7C12.6 14.8 12.49 14.87 12.37 14.91C12.26 14.95 12.13 14.97 12 14.97C11.87 14.97 11.74 14.95 11.62 14.91Z" fill="#006BAA"/> </g> </svg></div></button><section id="accordion-content-caniapplyformorethanonerole" aria-labelledby="accordion-button-caniapplyformorethanonerole" class="e-accordion-row__content" data-test-id="caniapplyformorethanonerole-accordion-body-text" style="display:none;" data-v-fe7dd93b><div class="e-accordion-row__body" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><div class="faqs__cms-rich-text" data-v-6bee4b86><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->No — we can only accept one application from you, so it’s important to choose the role you’re most excited about.<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section></div><div class="e-accordion-row" data-test-id="whatwillineedtoprovideattheapplicationstage-accordion" data-v-6bee4b86 data-v-fe7dd93b><button id="accordion-button-whatwillineedtoprovideattheapplicationstage" type="button" aria-controls="accordion-content-whatwillineedtoprovideattheapplicationstage" aria-expanded="false" class="e-accordion-row__header" data-gtm-track="div-What will I need to provide at the application stage?-open answer" data-test-id="whatwillineedtoprovideattheapplicationstage-accordion-header" data-v-fe7dd93b><!--[--><!----><span class="e-accordion-row__header-text" data-test-id="whatwillineedtoprovideattheapplicationstage-accordion-header-text" data-v-fe7dd93b>What will I need to provide at the application stage?</span><!--]--><div class="e-icon e-accordion-row__chevron" aria-hidden="true" data-icon="chevron_down" data-test-id="chevron_down" data-v-fe7dd93b data-v-d0e20aa0><svg height="24" width="24" style="line-height:24px" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><title>chevron down</title> <g> <path d="M11.62 14.91C11.51 14.87 11.4 14.8 11.3 14.7L6.7 10.1C6.52 9.92 6.42 9.68 6.42 9.4C6.42 9.12 6.52 8.88 6.7 8.7C6.88 8.52 7.12 8.43 7.4 8.43C7.68 8.43 7.92 8.52 8.1 8.7L12 12.6L15.9 8.7C16.08 8.52 16.32 8.43 16.6 8.43C16.88 8.43 17.12 8.52 17.3 8.7C17.48 8.88 17.57 